SF0196SS001/ADOPTED
Page 2-line 7 Delete "(f)" and insert "(h)".
Page 7-after line 19 Insert and renumber as necessary:
"(f) Any public officer, as defined in W.S. 6-5-101(a)(v), who knowingly
violates subsection (a) of this section is guilty of a misdemeanor punishable
by imprisonment for not more than one (1) year, a fine of not more than two
thousand dollars ($2,000.00), or both.
(g) Nothing in this section shall be construed to:
(i) Preclude any investigation and lawful seizure of firearms,
accessories or ammunition related to violations of Wyoming law;
(ii) Impose liability for civil penalties under this section on
individual public officers or peace officers.".
Page 7-line 21 Delete "(f)" and insert "(h)". FRENCH, CHAIRMAN
